<title>UK: Meteor Technology to restate year results.</title>
<headline>Meteor Technology to restate year results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meteor Technology Plc said on Monday that it has decided to restate its accounts for the year ended May 31, 1996 to reflect a write down of investments &quot;and other matters.&quot;</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that Aubrey Brockelbank, the only director who was a director at the time of the 1996 audit, resigned from the company on January 24.</p>
<p>Meteor said that the restatement will have no effect on Meteor's current activities and that details will be included in its interim results due February 28.</p>
<p>Meteor also said that it has replaced its auditors.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
